<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Crompton &amp; Knowles started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Crompton &amp; Knowles started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said it initiated coverage of Crompton &amp; Knowles Corp as a strong buy.</p>
<p>-- set a 12-18 month price target of $28 a share.</p>
<p>-- set 1997 earnings estimate of $1.20 a share and a 1998 estimate of $1.45 a share.</p>
</text>
